# Judge Hack — pipeline secrets
#
# These names are referenced from generated `.pipe` files as ${ROCKETRIDE_*}.
# Substitution is server-side. Set them in the org-scope Environment overlay
# (Account → Environment). Do not put values in the app bundle.
#
# Connection vars (ROCKETRIDE_URI / APIKEY / DEPLOY_*) live in the workspace
# `.env` managed by the editor — not here.

# Explain pipe (Haiku prose only; never scores).
ROCKETRIDE_ANTHROPIC_KEY=

# Per-judge, USER scope — not an org secret. Each judge stores their own GitHub
# personal access token from Settings → GitHub access in the app (or Account →
# Environment → user). Every GitHub read in a run uses it. Leave unset here.
# ROCKETRIDE_GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Personal Postgres placeholders were retired with hackjudge_sql_v1.external.pipe.
